    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hippoboar Rancher's cute catlike companion Eve stars in her very own game! Soar through space to collect Hippoboars, avoid the dangerous Thornies, and crank up your jet booster to set a new record!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features five different game modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normal mode: Jet your way through 30 treacherous waves to collect all the Hippoboars and bring home a bounteous dinner feast!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode: Test your endurance and see how many wave of Hippoboar-collecting you can muster before the you're overcome by Thornies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 Hippoboar BBQ: Collect all 100 Hippoboars as fast as possible and set a new time record!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 Second Trial: You have just half a minute, and there's Hippoboars everywhere! Can you grab them all before you run out of time?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Briar Patch Blitz: Brave the treacherous Thorny briar patch and practice your precision navigation to make your way to the center of the maze and claim your prize!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features music from MEGAFEPPS's CD &quot;Electronic Thunder&quot;.<br>CD available on MEGAFEPPS's official Booth shop.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hippoboar Rancher's cute catlike companion Eve stars in her very own game! Soar through space to collect Hippoboars, avoid the dangerous Thornies, and crank up your jet booster to set a new record!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features five different game modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normal mode: Jet your way through 30 treacherous waves to collect all the Hippoboars and bring home a bounteous dinner feast!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode: Test your endurance and see how many wave of Hippoboar-collecting you can muster before the you're overcome by Thornies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 Hippoboar BBQ: Collect all 100 Hippoboars as fast as possible and set a new time record!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 Second Trial: You have just half a minute, and there's Hippoboars everywhere! Can you grab them all before you run out of time?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Briar Patch Blitz: Brave the treacherous Thorny briar patch and practice your precision navigation to make your way to the center of the maze and claim your prize!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features music from MEGAFEPPS's CD &quot;Electronic Thunder&quot;.<br>CD available on MEGAFEPPS's official Booth shop.</p>",
